      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is starting to get hard to read. Usually people do one IF for each check, no ELSE, and throw an error (or reboot) inside the branch. The successful path is the one that never takes a branch.\n\n```\nfn main_wrapper(...) {\n  if mmio::guard::setup().is_err() {\n    reboot();\n  }\n\n  if logger::init(LevelFilter::Debug).is_err() {\n    reboot();\n  }\n\n  ...\n\n  jump_to_payload(fdt, payload);\n}\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 54,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 54,
        "endChar": 50
      },
      "revId": "8f974f2a4bbff2aa4c5c50ae78d6440bd8f8f987",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
